       61-GET-PUT-DEL-DTRANS.
           MOVE TC105-OLD-CODE           TO  CODE-ARG,
                                             BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO MATLCODE OF DTRANS-REC-O.
           START DTRANS-O KEY = MATLCODE OF DTRANS-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   GO TO 61-EXIT
               ELSE
                   MOVE "DBFIND DTRANS * 61-GPD-DTRANS - SCSASRNM"
                                         TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                   GO TO 61-EXIT.

      *------ GET THE DTRANS BUFFER FOR THE OLD CODE
           READ DTRANS-O NEXT INTO BUF-DTRANS
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   GO TO 61-EXIT
               ELSE
                   MOVE "DBGET DTRANS * 61-GPD-DTRANS - SCSASRNM"
                                         TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                   GO TO 61-EXIT.

           IF MATLCODE OF DTRANS-REC-O NOT = CODE-ARG
               GO TO 61-EXIT.

      *------- 20AUG1993 HAD TO REWORK THE FOLLOWING LOGIC
027100***** REPLACE THE NEW CODE FOR THE OLD CODE AND REWRITE THE
027200***** DTRANS BUFFER
      **
027400**   MOVE TC105-NEW-CODE           TO  TRANS-STORES-CODE.
      **   REWRITE DTRANS-REC-O FROM BUF-DTRANS
      **       INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
027700**   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
027800**       MOVE "REWRITE DTRANS * 61-GPD-DTRANS - SCSASRNM"
027900**                                 TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      **       MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
028000**       GO TO 61-EXIT.

      *------ SAVE BUF-DTRANS IN FIELD BUF-DTRANS2, AND CHANGE THE
      *------ CORPORATE CODE IN PREPARATION FOR WRITING THE NEW RECORD
           MOVE BUF-DTRANS     TO BUF-DTRANS2.
           MOVE TC105-NEW-CODE TO TRANS-STORES-CODE2.

      *------ DELETE THE DTRANS RECORD HAVING THE OLD CODE AS ITS KEY
           DELETE DTRANS-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBDELETE DTRANS * 61-GPD-DTRANS - SCSASRNM"
                 TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               GO TO 61-EXIT.

      *------ WRITE THE NEW DTRANS RECORD HAVING THE NEW CODE AS ITS KEY
           WRITE DTRANS-REC-O FROM BUF-DTRANS2
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT DTRANS2 * 61-GPD-DTRANS - SCSASRNM"
                 TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               GO TO 61-EXIT.

           GO TO  61-GET-PUT-DEL-DTRANS.

030300 61-EXIT.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO MATLCODE OF DTRANS-REC-O.
           START DTRANS-O KEY > MATLCODE OF DTRANS-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
035800
035900 2-BLOWUP.
036000*****MOVE "SCSASRNM"               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5).
036100     MOVE TC105-OLD-CODE           TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3).
036200     MOVE TC105-NEW-CODE           TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4).
036300     GOBACK.
